Package: kultarr
Title: High Dimensional Visualization of Anchors Explanations 
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Janith", "Wanniarachchi", email = "janithcwanni@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7945-1036"))
Description: Create and visualize 'Anchors' as specified in Ribeiro et al. (2018) <doi:10.1609/aaai.v32i1.11491> with a simple to understand intuitive approach. In addition, tools to visualize the data and the explanations in high dimensions using the 'tourrs' method are provided.
